l,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-05-31T08:31:13Z","updated_at":"2025-05-31T10:36:54Z","closed_at":"2025-05-31T09:31:44Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106988","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106988","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106988.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106988.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Adds a new Godot editor plugin module `ai_chat_interface`.\r\n\r\nThis plugin provides a dockable chat interface within the Godot editor, designed to communicate with an AI backend (e.g., via Cloudflare Workers) over WebSockets.\r\n\r\nKey features implemented:\r\n- Basic plugin structure and registration.\r\n- Chat UI with message history, input field, and send button.\r\n- WebSocket client integration for backend communication.\r\n- Core functionalities:\r\n  - Scene Manipulation: Handles a `CREATE_NODE` command from the AI to create new nodes in the edited scene, with undo/redo support.\r\n  - Scripting Assistance: Handles an `INSERT_CODE_SNIPPET` command to insert code into the active script editor, with undo/redo support.\r\n- Project Understanding:\r\n  - Handles a `GET_PROJECT_SETTING` command to retrieve and send project settings to the AI.\r\n  - Handles a `LIST_SCENE_FILES` command to scan and send a list of scene files to the AI.\r\n\r\nThis implementation serves as a proof of concept for an AI-first game development experience within the Godot editor. Further testing, refinement, and expansion of 